'@@author Rixte
@startuml
!include ../shortfall/readable.iuml
title Rejecting an invalid edit
actor User
participant MishMash as App
participant Parser
User -> App : edit-recipe 1 n/Changed p/-5
App -> Parser : parseCommand(input)
Parser -> Parser : parseRecipeIndex("1")
Parser -> Parser : collectRecipeArguments(...)
Parser -> Parser : parseOptionalNutrition(\nfields, "p", "Protein")
Parser -> Parser : parseNutrition("-5", "Protein")
Parser --> Parser : throws IllegalArgumentException
Parser -> Parser : wrap with edit usage and cause
Parser --> App : throws MishMashException
App --> User : error, usage, next prompt
note over App, Parser
 No changes record or command created.
 Even n/Changed is not applied.
 Recipes, plan, and groceries stay unchanged.
end note

@enduml
'@@author
